  "about_item": [
    "Complete 3-in-1 Professional Pet Grooming Kit: This all-in-one pet grooming tool comes with a metal pet comb, dog and cat brush for shedding and silicone bath brush, serving as a practical undercoat rake for dogs, detangling brush and detangler brush. Built with a shedding blade for cats, it acts as an efficient pet hair remover, dog hair remover and cat hair remover for long haired dogs and cat brushes for indoor cats, it easily eliminates matted fur, tangled knots and loose hair to meet daily pet grooming needs",
    "Premium Rust-Proof Stainless Steel Construction: Our dog hair brush, cat hair brush, dog comb and cat comb deliver durable long-term performance. All hair combs adopt smooth rounded edges with New-Design dog brush safe design, preventing scratches and irritation to pets' sensitive skin. The ergonomic non-slip handle enables effortless, stable grooming. This deshedding dog brush and deshedding brush for cats is fully made of pet-safe materials, supporting safe daily grooming for kittens and adult pets of all breeds",
    "Dual-Tooth Pet Detangling Comb for Enhanced Efficiency: Our dual-tooth pet detangling comb greatly improves daily grooming efficiency. The wide-tooth side removes stubborn knots and shapes messy fur, while the dense-tooth side clears loose hair and dead undercoat. This shedding brush dog hair tool reaches pets' hard-to-groom areas including head, legs and tail that ordinary dog grooming brush cannot cover. Paired with the high-performance undercoat rake for dogs, the dog deshedding brush and dog shedding brush combo realizes one-stop detangling, dematting and deshedding for long-haired dogs and indoor double-coat cats",
    "Versatile Tool for All Pet Breeds and Fur Types: This versatile pet grooming tool fits all pet breeds and fur types, working as a professional dog brush for long haired dogs and daily grooming tool for cat brushes for indoor cats. It adapts to thin, thick, single and double-coated pets for daily care and seasonal shedding maintenance. Serving as an efficient pet hair remover and cat hair remover, it reduces floating hair to keep your home clean. Integrating detangling brush, deshedding brush for cats, dog hair remover and dual sided shedding blade for cats, this dog grooming kit replaces multiple single-function pet supplies",
    "Lightweight and Easy to Maintain Design: All MasterPeak grooming tools feature lightweight, compact and portable designs for easy storage and outdoor use. The stainless steel dog comb, cat comb, dog deshedding brush and deshedding brush for cats support quick water cleaning, while the silicone bath brush is dirt-resistant and easy to maintain. This durable shedding brush dog hair kit requires minimal upkeep for long-term repeated use, integrating bathing, massage, detangling and deshedding for daily pet care"
  ],
