      {
        "position": 6,
        "title": "Fantastic set for pet grooming",
        "text": "I ordered this set for our husky-malamute grand-doggie. I’ve seen the rake on social media and was very happy to get a chance to try it out on her.I have to say that this is probably the best rake-style comb we’ve ever used. We used it on our long-haired dachshund first. It got her undercoat without scraping her skin and we were able to comb her longer than we ever have because her skin didn’t get so over-sensitized. It’s very easy to use and versatile because it has two sides to choose from.The handle is made of durable plastic with rubber on the grip. It has a nice weight and balance to it. There’s a little thumb rest that makes this rake very easy to hold and use. The metal tines are heavy duty, but aren’t so sharp that they scrape the skin during use.To me, the comb and bath brush are a bonus because I really just needed the rake. The comb is made of similar materials as the rake and the bath brush is a soft silicone. Our cat enjoyed being brushed with the bath brush. I guess she felt left out and wanted some attention!Overall, this is a very nice, color coordinated set and at the current price of $7.99 is a super deal.",
        "rating": 5,
        "date": "August 3, 2026",
